    "explanation": "Mei does better on Maps where the fights happen on a small Capture Point (like Braxis Holdout), that have narrow passages where she can get more value from her kit (for example Cursed Hollow), and that have a Boss Camp that goes in lane once captured.\n\nWhen picking Ice Storm at Level 1, Mei has good waveclear, making her a good pick on Maps where macro is important. Keep in mind, though, that she will not be able to help you capture Mercenary Camps quickly."
